<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Start With the Size of the Gap</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The space above kitchen cabinets varies a lot. Some kitchens have a few inches, others two feet or more. The size of the gap decides what will look right: tall urns will be squashed in a narrow gap, and small jars will disappear in a big one. Measure from the top of the cabinets to the ceiling, then use the guide below.</p>



