<p class="wp-block-paragraph">One rule matters more than any style choice: keep decor away from the cooking area. The U.S. Fire Administration’s <a href="https://www.usfa.fema.gov/prevention/home-fires/prevent-fires/cooking/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cooking safety tips</a> say to keep anything that can catch fire away from your stovetop, so skip baskets, dried stems and paper near the range and the hood.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Quick Pick: Above-Cabinet Decor by Gap Size</h2>



